# Large local-only binaries. These must never sit inside the project root:
# Next's dev watcher and `next build`'s output file tracing both walk it, and
# half a gigabyte of binary there is a measurable stall on every start.
# They have been moved to ../_local-assets/.
*.mp4
!public/videos/*.mp4
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
_local-assets/
.md

*.exe
*.crdownload
